This list contains the top 50 accounts with the most followers on the photo and video-sharing social platform [[Instagram]].<ref name="Trackalytics">{{Cite web|url=https://www.trackalytics.com/the-most-followed-instagram-profiles/page/1/|title=The Most Followed Instagram Profiles|website=Trackalytics.com|accessdate=February 10, 2019}}</ref> As of June 2019, the most followed user is Instagram's own account, with over 303 million followers. [[Cristiano Ronaldo]] is the most followed individual, with over 171 million followers. Fifteen accounts have exceeded 100 million followers on the site.

